unz_copyright: selectany so /ORDER can place it

Kind: link-layout stand-in, as zlib 0003.

The reference holds the string right before vfs.c's .BIN table; the build
places it with layout/server.dll/common-data-order.txt, which only moves
COMDATs. Stock definition moves 5370 bytes.

--- a/unzip.c
+++ b/unzip.c
@@ -69,7 +69,7 @@
 #define SEEK_SET    0
 #endif
 
-const char unz_copyright[] =
+__declspec(selectany) const char unz_copyright[] =
    " unzip 0.15a Copyright 1998 Gilles Vollant ";
 
 /* unz_file_info_interntal contain internal info about a file in zipfile*/
